// AgentSkillService manages the Agent Skills of one tenant (epic gibson#1364).
//
// An Agent Skill is a folder in the Agent Skills format. The publisher packs the
// folder as an OCI image and pushes it to a registry that the tenant owns.
// PublishAgentSkill takes a reference with a digest. The daemon pulls the image
// by that digest, validates the folder, and stores the content in the database
// of the tenant. A load reads that database and never the registry.
//
// A new publish of a name adds a version and makes it the current version. An
// old digest stays readable. No default grant exists. A tenant admin grants an
// Agent Skill to one agent or to one mission with GrantAgentSkill.
//
// Authorization: every RPC carries a (gibson.auth.v1.authz) annotation.

